('An inflation-adjusted annuity replicating a $2,000 monthly benefit costs ~$380,000; a couple\'s combined benefit can be worth over $1M.','An\ninflation-adjusted annuity replicating','Plausible order of magnitude (implies ~6.3% real payout at 65; analyst recall, not fetched). '+U,[]),
